<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A0A1A7;--shiki-dark:#7F848E;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic;">// 等同于 printf(&quot;%s\\n&quot;, &quot;3.14159&quot;);</span></span>
